# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 041B:04DD"
msgid "Ah, I see you have endured the trials of the Obsidian Fortress, which means that you must have nearly completed your training. I will test you now, Disciple, to see if you are worthy to be an Acolyte. "
msgstr "啊，我看你熬過了黑曜石要塞的試煉，這表示你的訓練一定快完成了。門徒，現在我要考驗你，看看你是否配當學徒。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 041B:05BE"
msgid "In order to become one, you must first cast three spells. You may use my pentacle, one of my staves, and my reagents to prepare them. I will be the target of each. Fear not, for they will do me no harm. "
msgstr "要成為學徒，你必須先施展三道法術。你可以用我的五芒星陣、我的一根法杖和我的材料來準備。每道法術都以我為目標。別擔心，它們傷不了我。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 041B:0699"
msgid "First, cast the Flame Bolt spell, then the Explosion spell, and finally, summon a Daemon to assault me. Do this in order. Failure at this point will cost your life... and there is no turning back. "
msgstr "首先施展烈焰箭，然後是爆炸術，最後召喚一隻惡魔來攻擊我。照這個順序做。到了這一步，失敗就會賠上你的命……而且沒有回頭路。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 041B:06C6"
msgid "The test begins now... "
msgstr "考驗現在開始……"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 041B:073D"
msgid "Cast the Flame Bolt spell at me. "
msgstr "對我施展烈焰箭。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 041B:0780"
msgid "Cast the Explosion spell at me. "
msgstr "對我施展爆炸術。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 041B:07C1"
msgid "Summon a daemon to attack me. "
msgstr "召喚一隻惡魔來攻擊我。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 041B:07F7"
msgid "Banish the daemon. "
msgstr "驅逐那隻惡魔。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 041B:082A"
msgid "Drop the staff. "
msgstr "放下法杖。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 041B:0866"
msgid "Do it now. "
msgstr "現在就做。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 041B:08E2"
msgid "This is your last chance. You are about to fail... and that means your death. "
msgstr "這是你最後的機會。你就要失敗了……而失敗就意味著死亡。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 041B:09C2"
msgid "I did not send for you, insolent child. This fortress is my refuge, and for breaking its sanctity, you must die. "
msgstr "我沒有召你來，無禮的孩子。這座要塞是我的庇護所，你褻瀆了它的神聖，就必須死。"

# P13 batch 5
#. event 01 (use (talk))
msgctxt "bark 041B:0A41"
msgid "Come, Acolyte. We must begin the ceremony. "
msgstr "來吧，學徒。我們必須開始儀式了。"
